      <description>KPTZ is excited to be a part of the Jefferson County Connectivity Summit, hosted by the Production Alliance, from Friday, March 27 to Sunday, March 29. The Connectivity Summit is a multi-day community gathering at Fort Worden State Park. There will be workshops, conversations, and performances. KPTZ will be hosting an open house on Saturday,</description>
